sequenceDiagram
  participant MG as Authorized executive writer - role set not enumerated in sources
  participant FM as Project From_Management_Current.md (management-owned inbox)
  participant DA as Delivery Assurance
  participant CH as Chief of Staff
  participant OW as Owner (manual bus)
  participant PM as Project PM / Control Room chat
  participant TM as Project To_Management_Current.md (project-owned outbox)
  participant ES as Project Executive_Status_Current.md (snapshot)
  MG->>FM: write item with stable ID, message class, status, priority, exactly one activation class
  DA->>DA: index pending stable ID and activation class across projects
  alt IMMEDIATE_ACTIVATION_REQUIRED
    DA->>CH: verified activation packet, READY_FOR_CHIEF_RENDERING
    CH->>OW: PASTE INTO exact canonical PM chat name, plus copyable packet
    OW->>PM: manual paste of the packet
  else DEFER_UNTIL_NEXT_NATURAL_ACTIVATION
    Note over FM,PM: item waits, no manufactured wake-up, Delivery remembers the pending IDs
    OW->>PM: next natural activation for other legitimate substantive work
  else TRIGGER_BOUND
    Note over FM,DA: dormant until the dated or conditional trigger fires, then reassess from evidence and reclassify
  end
  PM->>PM: IDENTITY GATE - compare directive target project, root, mailbox, stable IDs with canonical local identity
  alt mismatch or ambiguous
    PM-->>OW: FAIL CLOSED - do not execute, do not write foreign surfaces, return the canonical destination
    Note over PM,TM: if foreign work was already processed it is NON_AUTHORITATIVE / BYPASS_SUSPECTED until the true PM reprocesses
  else match or explicit bounded delegation present
    PM->>FM: read all OPEN actionable items before substantive project work
    PM->>PM: evidence-first reconcile, drop already-consumed IDs, process in activation-class and priority order, bundle into one sync
    PM->>TM: Response-To incoming stable ID with explicit disposition (ACCEPT, MODIFY, DEFER, REJECT) or status
    PM->>ES: refresh only on material event, include BLOCKED_ACTIONS, SAFE_PREWORK_ALLOWED, SAFE_PARALLEL_WORK_ALLOWED
  end
  MG->>TM: read the matching Response-To
  MG->>FM: close the management-owned item (ACKNOWLEDGED, HANDLED, RESOLVED, WITHDRAWN or EXPIRED)
  DA->>DA: DONE_EVENT bound, pending ID removed, invariant checks, immediate No-Idle rescan
  CH->>CH: dedupe by stable ID, treat OPEN item with valid matching response as reconciliation lag, not a new Owner action
